@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Option A — UML component comparison (not recommended)
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 190

package "One trusted application release" {
 component "Web / command handlers" as H
 component "Mixed feature logic\nDirect cross-feature model access" as M
 component "Background / adapters" as W
 H --> M
 M --> W
}
database "Shared relational records" as DB
folder "Private bytes / native Git" as F
component "Provider / executor / target interfaces\nIndependent authority still required" as E
H --> DB : convenient direct access
M --> DB
W --> DB
M --> F
W --> E
note bottom of M
 Low initial packaging overhead; ownership and invariant checks can erode.
 This comparison does not endorse unsafe execution in the application.
end note
@enduml
